/**
 * What every configuration setting does, shown as the "?" tooltip next to its field. Kept in one place so the
 * wording stays consistent and is easy to review against the gateway's behavior (src/meritorder/config.py and
 * docs/10-how-it-decides.md). `backticks` render as code. Defaults here must match config.py.
 */

